---
import MainGridLayout from "@layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";
import licenseText from "../../LICENSE?raw";
---

<MainGridLayout hasOwnHeading title="License" description="License for the research and content on this site.">
    <div class="card-base px-9 py-6 w-full">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-90 mb-4">License</h1>
        <pre class="whitespace-pre-wrap text-75 text-sm leading-relaxed font-sans">{licenseText}</pre>
        <p class="text-50 text-sm mt-4">Third-party components keep their own licenses; see <code>THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md</code> in the repository.</p>
        <section class="mt-10" aria-labelledby="disclaimer">
            <h2 id="disclaimer" class="text-2xl font-bold text-90 mb-4">Disclaimer</h2>
            <div class="text-75 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-3">
                <p>This is my personal site. What I write here is my opinion. It doesn't speak for any current or past employer, and none of them has endorsed it.</p>
                <p>I don't publish confidential information from any employer or anyone else.</p>
                <p>Posts are snapshots. They reflect what I knew and tested on the date they went up. I may have been wrong, or changed my mind since. Benchmarks come from my own setup on the day I ran them, and yours will differ.</p>
                <p>Code, experiments and games here come as is, with no warranty. Check them before you rely on them. Nothing here is professional, legal, financial or security advice. To the extent the law allows, I'm not liable for losses from using anything on this site.</p>
                <p>Company and product names belong to their owners. Mentioning one isn't an endorsement, and a link doesn't vouch for the page it points to.</p>
                <p>I use AI tools for research, code and editing. I check the results, and I'm responsible for what I publish.</p>
                <p>If you find something wrong, tell me and I'll fix it.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</MainGridLayout>
